sequenceDiagram
    actor BrowserA as Browser on tenant-a host
    actor BrowserB as Browser on tenant-b host
    participant SSR as Next.js SSR
    participant BFFA as Tenant A BFF request
    participant BFFB as Tenant B BFF request
    participant API as NestJS tenant resolver
    participant Cache as Cache and session boundary

    BrowserA->>SSR: GET tenant-a host
    SSR->>BFFA: Internal fetch preserving tenant-a host
    BFFA->>API: Forward trusted tenant-a request
    API-->>BFFA: Tenant A data
    BFFA-->>SSR: Tenant A response
    SSR-->>BrowserA: Tenant A rendered page
    BrowserB->>SSR: GET tenant-b host
    SSR->>BFFB: Internal fetch preserving tenant-b host
    BFFB->>API: Forward trusted tenant-b request
    API-->>BFFB: Tenant B data
    BFFB-->>SSR: Tenant B response
    SSR-->>BrowserB: Tenant B rendered page
    Cache->>Cache: Verify host-aware keys and cookies

    Note over BrowserA,BrowserB: Evidence must show no logo, cart, order, session, or cache crossover.